864		// This handles agents whose exec mode doesn't fire UserPromptSubmit (e.g., Factory AI
865		// Droid). The transcript is the source of truth — if ExtractPrompts returns nothing,
866		// there genuinely were no prompts. We track whether backfill occurred so we can
867		// update session state after SaveStep (which may reinitialize state).
868		var backfilledPrompt string
